.TH PLUTO-CLI 1 "2026" "pluto-tx" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pluto-cli \- headless command line for pluto-tx and pluto-advanced-rx
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pluto-cli
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pluto-cli
transmits (\fBtx\fR), receives (\fBrx\fR) and lists devices (\fBdevices\fR) without a GUI, using the same flowgraphs as the apps. See /usr/share/doc/pluto-tx/README.pluto-cli.md.
.PP
Run
.B pluto-cli \-\-help
for all options.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/pluto-tx
program code
.TP
.I /usr/lib/pluto-tx
bundled native components (gr-m17, gr-lora_sdr, rade_c, ft8_lib, js8ref)
.TP
.I ~/.config/pluto-tx/web-trx.env
Web-TRX settings (password, port, TLS)
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/web-trx/
Web-TRX runtime data (log, PID, TLS certificate, sessions, TX log)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pluto-tx (1),
.BR pluto-advanced-rx (1),
.BR pluto-cli (1),
.BR web-trx (1),
.BR pluto-tx-doctor (1)
.PP
/usr/share/doc/pluto-tx/
